WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.614
This query shows AGE and direct subtraction side by
side For

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:11.754
short hospital stays the displayed results may look
similar The conceptual

00:00:11.768 --> 00:00:17.689
difference becomes more important across months and
years Always choose the function

00:00:17.715 --> 00:00:21.833
based on the meaning you want to communicate rather
than because two examples happen to

00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:23.136
produce similar text
